# REPLACE_WITH_ARMORED_PGP_PUBLIC_KEY_FOR_RELEASE_SIGNING
#
# Before tagging 1.0, export Pasta's release PGP public key and commit it here
# alongside the matching fingerprint in docs/release/signing-identities.json:
#
#   gpg --armor --export <PRIMARY_PGP_FINGERPRINT> > docs/release/release-key.asc
#
# ci/github/release-attach.sh fails closed until this file holds a valid armored
# PGP public key whose primary fingerprint matches signing-identities.json.
